+issueNumber: MDL-69961
+notes:
+  core:
+    - message: >-
+        Forgot password (password reset) tokens are now invalidated when a
+        user's email address is changed, when the user's password is changed
+        (via `\core\authentication\password::update()` /
+        `update_internal_user_password()`), or when a new password reset
+        token is generated. A new function
+        `core_login_delete_password_reset_tokens()` has been added to
+        invalidate all password reset tokens for a given user.
+      type: changed
